SRR14119412	PRJNA718867	SRP312922	SAMN18577967	SRX10489752	Homo sapiens	K1079MLN	K1079MLN	Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM5221518: K1079MLN Homo sapiens RNA-Seq	RNA-Seq	TRANSCRIPTOMIC	cDNA	SINGLE	ILLUMINA	Illumina HiSeq 2500	Tumor tissue was lysed in TRIzol reagent with RNA isolated following manufacturers instructions. RNA-seq libraries were prepared using theNEBNext Ultra RNA Library Prep Kit for Illumina (catalog E7530L). Briefly, 500 ng total RNA was used to isolate mRNA with the NEB Next Oligo dT Magnetic Isolation Module (catalog E7490L). The isolated mRNA undergoes fragmentation, priming, cDNA synthesis and end repair/dA-tail. Individual index primers for multiplexing were added during PCR library enrichment after adaptor ligation.	17755056	887752800	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR141/012/SRR14119412/SRR14119412.fastq.gz	f0475de4c9c6f72e56457e1e20d0a985	511657330
